  "prompt": "CH02_S02 \u2014 WORKFLOW 9 AGENT ROUTING CARD (not an image-model payload)\nMODEL: Foundations/assets use GPT Image 2.6 Flare / gpt_image_2_6_flare; expression/action edits use GPT Image 2.6 Sunburst / gpt_image_2_6. Both medium, 2K, 4:3, PNG, batch_size 1. Exact node parameters govern. Explicit transparent isolated assets / opaque backgrounds.\nREFERENCE: Read production/Reference_Lineage_Workflow.md and production/reference-lineage/catalog.json. Inspect/reuse the identity turnaround, approve the neutral posture/contact master, then edit each expression from exactly ONE approved neutral image. Never submit this routing card or the old numbered bundle to the model.\nDIRECTION AND STATE:\n- L: prince standing three-quarter facing LEFT, calm intent eyes, gently asking, one small open-hand gesture.\n  Actual short payload: production/reference-lineage/nodes/V_CH02_S02_L/PROMPT.txt\n- R: same child leaning slightly from the hips toward a drawing off-frame LEFT, thoughtful serious face, hands behind his back; no paper in his hands.\n  Actual short payload: production/reference-lineage/nodes/V_CH02_S02_R/PROMPT.txt\nL/R identify legacy logical states, not output columns. Generate a single state only when needed. All variants return to the same neutral master, never to a sibling expression. Preserve face, dot eyes, hair, clothes, age, anatomy, dimensions, camera, furniture and registration outside named edits. Protect stationary shadow/support pixels locally outside the measured edit region; no extra shadow. See workflow-9 registered-edit and matte-repair rules.\nAUDIT: Compare all offline identity/scale/story evidence; audit native alpha, emotion, exact contact and parent-shadow preservation. Read story-context.json and audit-contract.json. Old attachments stay for audit only. Accepted current artwork remains reusable and untouched.\nMEASURED CONTINUITY AND FRAMING LOCK: Use measured anatomy and support anchors from page layout.json; same camera keeps size/location. Final 2400\u00d71792 geometry remains unchanged; check actual 2K source pixels.\nCOMPOSITION CONTINUITY AND PERFORMANCE LOCK: One physical contact group, correct relative ratios, attached single-owner shadow, clear expression/gaze/recipient and meaningful unique page beat.\nTEXT-TO-ILLUSTRATION ALIGNMENT: Exact page story-context remains authoritative; no early reveal or invented contact. Thought contents are separate assets.\nTHOUGHT AESTHETICS AND SCENE HIERARCHY: Selected thoughts only, readable quiet watercolor contents, adapted frame and three owner-linked puffs; do not crowd the page.\nBUDGET: At most THREE global attempts including historical sheets. The third requires a changed mechanism and no-cost feasibility evidence. One live job, bounded spend window, reuse first. Review diagnostic boards OFFLINE; submit clean authority images. Recompile ambiguous prompts with a recorded semantic diff. Follow production/workflow-9/PROCESS.md. Stop after one chapter for manual approval.\n",
